t in the Denver Zoning Code or Former Chapter 59 according to the listed instructions for the baseline information on the district."], [3, "Commercial Construction Cost Per Square Foot - Digital Builder\nMay 19, 2025 \u00b7 Due to climate differences, the building costs in the US Midwest vary. However, the expenses are averaged from three cities in the Midwest: Denver , Nashville, and Chicago."]], "participants": null}}, "prompt_chain": [{"step": 0, "id": "ner_001", "crc": 1321322, "title": "Extract named entities from documents", "name": "extract_named_entities", "description": "Identifies and extracts named entities from provided documents.", "type": "inference", "input_path": "ner", "prompt_template": "Extract all named entities from the provided document. Include the following entity types: PERSON, ORGANIZATION, LOCATION, and any other relevant entities. Return as comma-delimited list of entities with their types (e.g., 'John Smith (PERSON), ACM Corp (ORGANIZATION)). Only return the entities without any additional commentary.", "output_variable": "extracted_entities", "output_type": "List[str]"}], "example_output": {"tags": ["guitar", "barn", "farm", "nashville"], "type": "List[str]"}}, "result": {"tags": ["city and county of denver", "denver", "south platte river committee", "denver city council", "denver planning board", "chair jamie torres", "vice chair sarah parady", "amanda sandoval", "flor alvidrez", "kevin flynn", "chris hinds", "darrell watson", "melissa mata", "council bill 26-0521", "denver zoning code", "former chapter 59", "361-363 west evans avenue", "council district 7", "digital builder", "us midwest", "nashville", "chicago"], "vectors": null}, "error": null}
