n charged"], [0, "A crazy amount of times with violating his own daughter. And then when this guy shows up at his house, kidnaps her in the middle of the night, he goes and finds them, runs them off the road because she's being taken. They did call the police, by the way. The police didn't show up till far later."], [0, "rescues his daughter and in the process, yes, shoots the man to death who's already essayed her and who is actively kidnapping her at that moment in time. And now Lono County says, well, that's second degree murder. You just wanted to go kill him. No, no, he had every opportunity and didn't do that. He didn't act until the guy actually stole his kid."], [0, "But Lowenow County, you want to keep running your mouth. You want to keep running this narrative that this is some father that went vigilante, which it's not. This is a father who actively went to stop an active kidnapping to save his daughter's life. You go ahead. You keep pushing that narrative and we'll keep pushing back and making you all look like the goddamn fools that you are. And we'll dig deeper. We can dig so deep."], [0, "We'll dig into each and every one of you deep, your history, your past, the shit you don't want people to know about. Is it criminal? Why are you defending? Why are you actively defending a man who is a known predator? He's dead now."]], "participants": []}, "input_categories": ["News & Politics"]}, "prompt_chain": [{"step": 0, "id": "12346546888", "crc": 1321321, "title": "Infer tags from a conversation window", "name": "infer_tags_from_a_conversation_window", "description": "Returns tags representing the conversation as a whole from the window received.", "type": "inference", "input_path": "conversation", "prompt_template": "Analyze conversation in terms of topic interests of the participants. Analyze the conversation (provided in structured XML format) where <p0> has the questions and <p1> has the answers. Return comma-delimited tags. Only return the tags without any English commentary.", "output_variable": "final_output", "output_type": "List[str]"}], "example_output": {"tags": ["guitar", "barn", "farm", "nashville"], "type": "List[str]"}}, "result": {"tags": ["criminal charges", "second degree murder", "sheriff election", "republican primary", "county politics", "arkansas", "supreme court", "judicial removal", "law enforcement", "prosecution", "child abduction", "self defense", "political scandal", "media commentary", "legal ethics", "vigilantism", "sexual abuse", "public outrage"], "vectors": null}, "error": null}
{"timestamp": 1778710603.6271663, "duration_sec": 2.2979044914245605, "validator_hotkey": "5C8LULGoFybR7ybg4S8qQkaaowGXFFja4KmMoSqwhxuAsn33", "task_type": "conversation_tagging", "task_raw": {"mode": "testnet", "api_version": 2.1, "guid": "HIDDEN", "bundle_guid": "HIDDEN", "type": "conversation_tagging", "scoring_mechanism": "ground_truth_tag_similarity_scoring", "input": {"guid": "HIDDEN", "input_type": "conversation", "data": {"window_idx": -1, "window": [[0, "The Gracies were smart. They were very smart at that time in knowing, you know, the right people to kind of pick at that time, because, you know, there was some\u2014 there was some killers out there."], [1, "There were some killers out there. Yeah, they definitely set it up, especially the early ones. But it's also\u2014 it's like, you know, that was\u2014 it was good for us to see a guy like Royce who wasn't jacked. He was a slender guy who weighed 175 pounds, and he was strangling everybody and arm barring everybody. It was wild to see when he beat Dan Severn. Dan Severn was 260 pounds and Royce tapped him off his back with a triangle."], [0, "Man, what a story. That put, that put jiu-jitsu on the map, on the map big time. But you know, one thing that always broke my heart is people never knew about Hickson, right? Oh my God, I know that dude. Yeah, that cat was like\u2014 I always considered him like pound for pound the best because he He had this, not only jiu-jitsu skills, but just his concentration. And he was almost like hypnotic. And just no waste of energy. Just unbelievable. What an amazing person to watch. I would encourage anybody to pull up his fights. Talk about David versus Goliath stuff."], [1, "Oh yeah, another great example of cross-training too, 'cause Hickson got really into yoga. and everybody's like, what the fuck are you doing? Yoga? Like, yoga's for girls, right? Hickson got really into yoga and got super flexible and suit. And really good at controlling his breathing."], [0, "Oh, yeah, yeah."], [1, "And never got tired."], [0, "Yeah. You saw him in that. In the Hulk. Oh, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah. It's something, man. That's. Talk about a legend."], [1, "Oh, real legend."], [0, "Yeah. Yeah, man."], [1, "Well, Hickson, there's a video of him, and he did this multiple times where he would go to these gyms and he would teach a seminar, like a long seminar, and then roll with all the black belts and just tap them one after the other. One\u2014 world champions, guys that just didn't understand what was going on. Like, how is this happening? Oh yeah, like Paulo Filho when he was a WEC world champion and he was\u2014 he had won the Mundials, I believe. He'd won multiple jiu-jitsu championships. And he trained with Hickson. He's like, man, it's true. He goes, I can't believe it. He goes, that guy treated me like I didn't even belong in there. It was crazy. And Hickson by that time was probably like 40."]], "participants": []}, "input_categories": ["Comedy"]}, "prompt_chain": [{"step": 0, "id": "12346546888", "crc": 1321321, "title": "Infer tags from a conversation window", "name": "infer_tags_from_a_conversation_window", "description": "Returns tags representing the conversation as a whole from the window received.", "type": "inference", "input_path": "conversation", "prompt_template": "Analyze conversation in terms of topic interests of the participants. Analyze the conversation (provided in structured XML format) where <p0> has the questions and <p1> has the answers. Return comma-delimited tags. Only return the tags without any English commentary.", "output_variable": "final_output", "output_type": "List[str]"}], "example_output": {"tags": ["guitar", "barn", "farm", "nashville"], "type": "List[str]"}}, "result": {"tags": ["brazilian jiu jitsu", "gracie family", "hickson gracie", "royce gracie", "early ufc", "mixed martial arts", "grappling", "triangle choke", "armbar", "weight classes", "cross training", "martial arts legends", "yoga", "breathing